      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "LBH电器的研发部门由创始人Tina领导，汇聚了一批杰出的工程师和设计师。我们致力于高质量的研发和卓越的成果，成立四年内便获得了40多项专利。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720486399",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们团队的目标是为您带来市场上最优质的新产品，好的设计始于您的想法和建议，我们以此为基础，确定您的需求，并运用我们的制造经验，为您提供精准的解决方案。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720486399",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "每次我们开始设计一款新的个护家电产品时，我们都会清空思绪，打破既定的思维模式。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720486453",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "—— 首席设计师Jeff",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720486453",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "20px",
