      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "40px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "text": "我们的设施和设备确保了形式和功能",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_724142962",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "40px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "60px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "在制作原型时，我们关注每一个细节，从尺寸和形状再到生产成本和时间。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720486474",
      "main": true,
      "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Tahoma, \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Heiti SC\", \"WenQuanYi Micro Hei\", sans-serif",
      "fontSize": "16px",
      "fontWeight": "400",
      "fontStyle": "normal",
      "lineHeight": "32px",
      "letterSpacing": "normal",
      "textTransform": "none",
      "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
      "text": "之后，我们根据最终设计制作模具，这不仅能展现产品的精确形状，还能确保在生产过程中实现其功能性。",
      "tag": "SPAN",
      "cls": "",
      "module": "module_720486474",
      "main": true,
